{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/7ad0621bbfd203f45fc412818cb2bc79.poster.avif?t=1760107948\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/7ad0621bbfd203f45fc412818cb2bc79.webm?t=1760107948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking from a nightmare, Sophie finds herself in an ever-changing dorm, with no memory of how she ended up there, while a mysterious entity tries to corrupt her mind and manipulate her identity. Can you lead Sophie out with her sanity intact?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Narrative:</strong> Every mistake erases pieces of the truth about your past and the entity twisting your mind.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Gameplay:</strong> Answer and act carefully in twisted questions where there is no single right or wrong. Solve them by uncovering clues and using the items you find along the way.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Terror:</strong> Unpredictable events and multiple endings keep every playthrough tense. Will this be the one where you finally escape?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow-Burn Psychological Dread:</strong> No cheap jumpscares - only dread, mystery, and mind-bending unease that lingers long after the screen fades to black.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/ccbbdcb28396a35db5ceb6212f4c49cb.poster.avif?t=1760107948\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/ccbbdcb28396a35db5ceb6212f4c49cb.webm?t=1760107948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2204820?t=1760107948","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/a7dce53b8eca1b76e3e6614a39410903a706c80b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760107948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/d85d8f7d8ea9d2986af61ec5a89be42222b5a3f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760107948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/d85d8f7d8ea9d2986af61ec5a89be42222b5a3f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760107948","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4089370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/7ad0621bbfd203f45fc412818cb2bc79.poster.avif?t=1760107948\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/7ad0621bbfd203f45fc412818cb2bc79.webm?t=1760107948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking from a nightmare, Sophie finds herself in an ever-changing dorm, with no memory of how she ended up there, while a mysterious entity tries to corrupt her mind and manipulate her identity. Can you lead Sophie out with her sanity intact?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Narrative:</strong> Every mistake erases pieces of the truth about your past and the entity twisting your mind.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Gameplay:</strong> Answer and act carefully in twisted questions where there is no single right or wrong. Solve them by uncovering clues and using the items you find along the way.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Terror:</strong> Unpredictable events and multiple endings keep every playthrough tense. Will this be the one where you finally escape?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow-Burn Psychological Dread:</strong> No cheap jumpscares - only dread, mystery, and mind-bending unease that lingers long after the screen fades to black.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/ccbbdcb28396a35db5ceb6212f4c49cb.poster.avif?t=1760107948\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/ccbbdcb28396a35db5ceb6212f4c49cb.webm?t=1760107948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Youviverse"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/ef484f74b7f567577ee12521aafbe0a13b15b36e/header.jpg?t=1760107948","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Cerebral \u00a9 2025 Youviverse. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2204820/1828544215/5a464ec1196a0fdd4